    'Nothing was moved - more than one booking that date matches "' + wantedTitle + '":\n'
    + hits.map(e => '- ' + (e.summary || '(no title)') + ' ' + when(e)).join('\n')
    + '\nAsk which one they mean, then call Move Booking again with that exact title.');
}
if (!ev) return bad('NOT_ON_CALENDAR',
  'Nothing was moved - no booking on that date matches what you gave. These are the only bookings on that date:\n'
  + (items.map(e => '- ' + (e.summary || '(no title)') + ' ' + when(e)).join('\n') || '(none)'));

